(label "VBUS" (at 157.48 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c76e87eb-b523-5561-80d1-6f9c881264b3"))
(text "jank tiny (hardware/tiny/README.md). POWER: J3 POWER IN (a gear's MIDI OUT / THRU via a TRS-to-DIN type A adaptor): ring (DIN 4) and tip (DIN 5) each through 47 ohm and a B5819W into VSYS, sleeve (DIN 2) = GND. USB VBUS joins VSYS through D3 and R5 4.7 ohm." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fe455d0e-6f52-5ff7-8021-b3b9d97e2ced"))
(text "VSYS: C1 + C2 (2 x 2200 uF) and C3. U2 TPS62842 makes +3V3 (R7 51k), enabled by BUCK_EN = U3 (VSYS above ~4.16 V rising, 4.0 V falling) OR VBUS OR PWR_HOLD (GPIO4), through D4 / D5; C4 + R6 keep it ~1 s after they drop." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 16.509999999999998 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4b19a1fa-6576-5a27-ae6a-c5acd3582352"))
(text "MIDI OUT J2 (to a gear's MIDI IN, type A): ring = +3V3 through R14 33 ohm, tip = MIDI_TX (GPIO21) through R15 10 ohm, sleeve = GND. P2 / P3: solder pads for a cable instead of each jack." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b7ba1c61-c825-5084-9b2a-151aa94ecde0"))
(text "Pins: GPIO21 MIDI_TX, GPIO38 LED, GPIO0 BOOT, GPIO1 VBANK_ADC (VSYS / 2), GPIO2 VBUS_SENSE (VBUS / 2), GPIO4 PWR_HOLD, GPIO19 / 20 USB D- / D+." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "482abfb7-505b-5432-baca-0662f09c5313"))
